### Arquivo para a extensão REST Client (VS Code) ou HTTP Client (IntelliJ)
@base = http://localhost:8080

### Cadastro público (cria USER)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Bia", "email": "bia@rivaia.com", "password": "Senha@1234"}

### Login USER
# @name loginUser
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "bia@rivaia.com", "password": "Senha@1234"}

### Meu perfil
GET {{base}}/api/v1/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{loginUser.response.body.accessToken}}

### USER tentando listar usuários (espera 403)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/users
Authorization: Bearer {{loginUser.response.body.accessToken}}

### Login ADMIN
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "admin@rivaia.com", "password": "Admin@12345"}

### ADMIN lista usuários
GET {{base}}/api/v1/users?page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.accessToken}}

### ADMIN cria usuário
POST {{base}}/api/v1/users
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Analista", "email": "analista@rivaia.com", "password": "Senha@1234", "role": "USER"}

### Sem token (espera 401)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/users/me

### Chave pública
GET {{base}}/.well-known/jwks.json
